NameSubstanceReshapingDevice=Substance Reshaping Device
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_MachineType=Substance Reshaping Device
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_Controller=Controller block for the Substance Reshaping Device
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_00=Void begets all things, and chaos forges gods. All matter can be reshaped, but great power cannot be defied.
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_01=The laws of the universe are both a cage and a shackle. All things follow the path of entropy—life will inevitably decay, stars will burn out, and dust will return to dust. But we refuse to accept this fate.
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_02=They are nameless entities, echoes from beyond reality, remnants we brought back from the unknown when we tampered with the laws of the universe.
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_03=We are the creators of stars, the manipulators of reality, and the ultimate masters of gravity!
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_04=Some particles exhibit arrangements that defy known physical rules, some substances exist in ways that violate the laws of thermodynamics.
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_05=and some creations… vanish the moment we attempt to document them, as if they never existed at all.
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_06=The machine supports cross-recipe parallel processing!
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_07=Supports up to 10 recipes running simultaneously! The optimal ratio for each recipe is 10*10!
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_08=If any recipe exceeds 10 units in operation, it will cause a decrease in total parallel efficiency!
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_09=But remember this—creators are also destroyers.
Tooltip_SubstanceReshapingDevice_10="When the gods fall silent, mortals may seize the mantle of power. But remember, the mantle was never truly ours to claim."
SubstanceReshapingDeviceRecipes=Singularity Stabilization Ring Casings Live:  %s
NameBlueDogMachine=Blue Dog Fountain
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_MachineType=Blue Dog Fountain
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_Controller=Controller Block of Blue Dog Fountain
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_00=In honor of BlueDog — the legendary creator of unofficial mods!
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_01=A legendary device that turns regular water into ultra-pure water — with nothing else!Rumor has it the idea came from a team outing…
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_02=Putting a Hotdog Ingot into the machine seems to get it... a little too excited?
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_03=Oh, and you’d better not look too closely at where the water comes out… It’s not exactly elegant.
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_04=“He doesn’t look very comfortable, does he?”
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_05=“Not really. He might actually be enjoying it…”
Tooltip_BlueDogMachine_06=Enjoy yourself — you’re definitely going to like him!
NameMonkeyShit=The Holy Royal High Priest of Poop Transportation
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_MachineType=The Holy Royal High Priest of Poop Transportation
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_Controller=Controller Block of The Holy Royal High Priest of Poop Transportation
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_00=The Relentless Poop Mover!
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_01=Seriously?! Where on earth did he get all this crap!?
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_02=At times, he walks near the gods... yet strays far from mankind.
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_03=“Please, post something else, I’m begging you!”
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_04=F*** it, you might as well post crap instead of this nonsense!
Tooltip_MonkeyShit_05=Just pour some smelly liquid into the machine — who knows what kind of surprise you’ll get!
NameOrundumDynamo=Orundum Dynamo
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_MachineType=Orundum Dynamo
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_Controller=Controller Block of Orundum Dynamo
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_00=A wondrous device brought from another continent — it runs on pure Originite Prime power!
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_01=It creates an entirely new source of energy!An all-new internal Originium network system!
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_02=Upgrade the coils and glass to achieve greater efficiency and improved parallel performance.
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_03=Every unit of Originite Prime converts into Orundum once it’s used up.
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_04=Completely free from Originium dust contamination!
Tooltip_OrundumDynamo_05=The very dawn of the Originium industry—good luck out there, Administrator!
NameElectricTypeOneMiningMachine=Electric Type-I Mining Machine
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_MachineType=Power Miner
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_Controller=Controller Block of Electric Type-I Mining Machine
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_00=The Electric Type-I Mining Machine is the first piece of equipment you gain access to for fully automated mining of Orundum ore veins.
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_01=Just set the structure on top of the Orundum ore veins unique to Planet Talos and it will start operating!
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_02=The machine requires at least one Originite Prime Main Vein Block within its detection range to operate.
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_03=The detection range is a 7×7×3 cubic area that starts one block behind and two blocks below the machine’s main block.
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_04=By default, the machine operates with a single parallel line, yielding 10 Orundum ore every 10 seconds.
Tooltip_ElectricTypeOneMiningMachine_05=You can later increase its output by placing upgrade modules inside the main block!
